{"id":"648243","name":"红豆馅青团","author":"Dinaking","authorId":"12567629","desc":"","cover":"images/648243/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"青团预拌粉","amount":"250克"},{"name":"热水","amount":"130克"},{"name":"玉米油","amount":"25克"}],"sub":[{"name":"红豆馅","amount":"260克"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"准备好所有材料。","img":"images/648243/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"将青团预拌粉倒入盘中，加入25克玉米油。","img":"images/648243/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"加入130克开水。","img":"images/648243/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"用筷子搅拌成絮状。","img":"images/648243/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"然后揉成面团。","img":"images/648243/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"将面团分成30克，一个的小剂子盖上保鲜膜。","img":"images/648243/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"将红豆馅分成20克一个的小剂子揉圆。","img":"images/648243/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"将面团摊开，包入红豆馅，用虎口把面团往上推，收口后再揉圆。","img":"images/648243/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"全部做好后摆入蒸盘中。","img":"images/648243/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"锅中放入清水，水开后放入蒸盘蒸8分钟。","img":"images/648243/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"完成。","img":"images/648243/step_11.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：蒸锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}